@codingjoe I found the [discussion](https://github.com/django/django/pull/21241#issue-4399773565):

> I had to cast strings to media assets early to be able to deduplicate CSS assets based on their media query. It uses hash identity, not equality.

I'm presuming that safe-strings imply verbatim rendering and no deduplication.

